  "description": "Accessibility for Umbraco: a Content-section dashboard that scans your published pages with axe-core against WCAG 2.0, 2.1 or 2.2 at level A, AA or AAA, scores the site, explains every issue with why it matters, how to fix it and caveats, and keeps a manual checklist for what a machine can't judge. Optional visitor features follow the visitor's reduced-motion and contrast settings and add an accessibility preferences panel, each switchable on and off.",
